  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 111770,
  "published": "2026-10-16T00:17:02.733Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0-rc.2.4: SkiaGalleryView shows a spinner on a page whose picture is still loading and a crossed-out picture when its source gives no image, on a page and inside SkiaCollectionView (where it follows the list's ShowImageLoadingIndicator, ShowImageErrorIndicator and ImageIndicatorColor). Requires SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.4.\n\n0.1.0-rc.2.3: built on SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.3.\n\n0.1.0-rc.2.2: built on SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.2.\n\n0.1.0-rc.2.1: SkiaToggleButton works inside SkiaCollectionView item templates: rows are drawn from their items, a tap writes SelectedValue (or a SkiaToggleGroup container's) into the row's item and runs Command, groups follow, a drag scrolls the list. Requires SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.1.\n\n0.1.0-rc.2: First preview. SkiaCalendarView, SkiaToggleButton, SkiaComboBox, SkiaSelectorView and SkiaGalleryView (swipeable images with page indicators; inside SkiaCollectionView item templates it is baked with the row and comes alive under the finger). Requires .NET 11 / MAUI 11 RC2.",
